        "......",
        "......"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orbeck of Vinheim",
      "name_en": "Orbeck of Vinheim",
      "kind": "Merchant",
      "x": 2520,
      "y": 1840,
      "color": "#7090B0",
      "dialogue": [
        "Well, this is unexpected. I don't often have visitors. What do you want? This is my study that you've happened upon.",
        "How intriguing. Very well. Indeed, I am a sorcerer. With plenty to share. But you will make me a promise. That in exchange for my teaching, you will bring me knowledge. In the form of scrolls detailing sorcery's secrets."
      ]
    },
